<title>HONG KONG: China Resources interim net up 62.7 pct.</title>
<headline>China Resources interim net up 62.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>		(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Share (H.K. cents)	11.9     vs     8.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0     vs     2.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil     vs     nil</p>
<p>    Net			  140.38    vs     86.27</p>
<p>    Turnover		   707.44    vs    419.01</p>
<p>    Company name:		 China Resources Enterprise Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close:		  October 14-18</p>
<p>    Dividend payable:	   October 24</p>
<p>NOTE - China Resources operates cold storage, brewery and property businesses. Earnings per share is weighted on the average of 1.18 billion shares in issue during the period under review, compared with 1.06 billion shares during the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
